      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The reservation was formally established under the Indian Reorganization Act of 1934, giving the Kaibab Band legal recognition.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grcahistory.org/sites/beyond-park-boundaries/kaibab-paiute-reservation/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In the late 1800s, the area that is now Moccasin was part of the broader Kaibab region, which later became a CDP.",
